ription of First Aid Measures) Tj 1 0 0 1 45 370 Tm (Eye Contact: Flush immediately with continuous stream of clean water for at least 20 minutes.) Tj 1 0 0 1 45 356 Tm (Hold eyelids open to ensure complete irrigation. Transport immediately to an ophthalmologist.) Tj 1 0 0 1 45 342 Tm (Skin Contact: Immediately remove all contaminated clothing. Wash skin with soap and water for 15 min.) Tj 1 0 0 1 45 328 Tm (Inhalation: Move exposed person to fresh air. If breathing is labored, administer oxygen.) Tj 1 0 0 1 45 314 Tm (Ingestion: Do NOT induce vomiting. Rinse mouth thoroughly. Call Emergency 112 immediately.) Tj ET
